# Offline-restore artifacts (7b-3): the pre-restore safety snapshot (the whole
# member directory in plaintext — REAL PII in a PUBLIC repo), the restore report,
# the forensic audit entry and the Ghost discrepancy report. Unanchored, so it
# matches at any depth: the tool's default out-dir is relative to the working
# directory, and the documented invocation (`npm run restore --workspace apps/api`)
# runs with cwd `apps/api/`, so they land in `apps/api/restore-artifacts/`.
restore-artifacts/
